server.dll is the CS2 server plugin from CS Demo Manager
https://github.com/akiver/cs-demo-manager (cs2-server-plugin/), MIT License.

Copyright (c) Anthony Killer (akiver)

Reel downloads this binary from the live GitHub tree
(static/cs2/server.dll on main) via `reel-core update-tools`.
The plugin executes console commands at specific demo ticks, driven by a
<demo>.json actions file, and is loaded via a temporary gameinfo.gi search path.

Do not join VAC-secured servers while the plugin / HLAE is loaded (-insecure).
